Package: EasyCalculator
Title: Financial calculators
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Rakesh", "Poduval", , "poduval.rakesh@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A collection of easy to use financial calculators for India.
    Currently includes an income tax calculator (old and new regimes) that
    works for one person or a whole data frame; more calculators such as GST
    and loan schedules are planned.
